-full bg-[#059669]/10 opacity-50 blur-3xl\"></div></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"text-center lg:text-left\"><div class=\"inline-block mb-4 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/50 border border-[#059669]/10 backdrop-blur-sm\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-[#064e3b] uppercase\">The Standard in Crowdfunding</span></div><h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-[#064e3b] tracking-tight mb-6\">Empower the Future with <br class=\"hidden lg:block\"/><span class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#059669] to-[#064e3b]\">Jade Fortune</span></h1><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-xl text-[#064e3b]/80 mb-10 leading-relaxed\">Discover and fund transformative projects. A secure platform connecting visionary creators, diligent issuers, and passionate investors.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center lg:justify-start items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-emerald-900 border-b-[4px] border-emerald-950 text-white rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:brightness-110 active:translate-y-[2px] active:border-b-[2px] transition-all duration-100 shadow-lg hover:shadow-emerald-600/10 text-center\" href=\"/projects\">Browse Projects</a><a class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-[#fcfaf5] text-[#064e3b] border border-[#059669]/20 border-b-[4px] border-b-[#e5dccb] rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-[#ecfdf5] active:translate-y-[2px] active:border-b-[2px] transition-all duration-100 text-center\" href=\"/how-it-works\">Start a Project</a></div></div><div class=\"relative hidden lg:block\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#ecfdf5] to-transparent rounded-3xl transform rotate-3 scale-105 opacity-50 blur-lg\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 p-8 bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-[#f2eadb] rounded-3xl shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#fdfbf7] rounded-2xl border border-[#059669]/10 shadow-sm text-center transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#059669] mb-2\">$<!-- -->0<!-- -->M+</p><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b]/70 uppercase tracking-wider\">Total Raised</p></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#fdfbf7] rounded-2xl border border-[#059669]/10 shadow-sm text-center transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#059669] mb-2\">0<!-- -->+</p><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b]/70 uppercase tracking-wider\">Projects Funded</p></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#fdfbf7] rounded-2xl border border-[#059669]/10 shadow-sm text-center transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#059669] mb-2\">0<!-- -->k+</p><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b]/70 uppercase tracking-wider\">Happy Backers</p></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-[#fdfbf7] rounded-2xl border border-[#059669]/10 shadow-sm text-center transform transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1 duration-300\"><p class=\"text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#059669] mb-2\">0<!-- -->%</p><p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-[#064e3b]/70 uppercase tracking-wider\">Issuer Projects</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-12 bg-white border-y border-[#059669]/10 relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"pt-2\"><p class=\"text-center text-sm font-semibold text-[#064e3b]/50 uppercase tracking-widest mb-8\">Trusted by leading publications</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-8 lg:gap-16 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-serif text-[#064e3b]\">Forbes</div><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#064e3b]\">TechCrunch</div><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-[#064e3b]\">WIRED</div><div class=\"text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#064e3b] italic\">Bloomberg</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-[#fffcf8] relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-4\">Why Choose Jade Fortune?</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-[#064e3b]/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">A purpose-built ecosystem designed for both visionary creators and discerning backers.</p><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#059669] mx-auto rounded-full mt-6\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-6 relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#059669] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl\">🛡️</span>For Backers</h3><ul class=\"space-y-4 relative z-10\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Rigorous Auditing:</strong> Every project undergoes strict vetting.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>High-Yield Potential:</strong> Access curated early-stage opportunities.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Transparent Ecosystem:</strong> Track investments with real-time updates.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-[#064e3b] p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg shadow-[#064e3b]/20 border border-[#064e3b] relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#059669] rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 opacity-50\"></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white text-[#064e3b] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\">🚀</span>For Creators</h3><ul class=\"space-y-4 relative z-10\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Fair Funding:</strong> All-or-nothing or flexible models to suit your needs.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Global Reach:</strong> Connect with verified investors globally.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Expert Guidance:</strong> Get audited to prove your project&#x27;s viability.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-6 relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#059669] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xl\">🔍</span>For Issuers</h3><ul class=\"space-y-4 relative z-10\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Monetize Expertise:</strong> Earn fees by conducting thorough reviews.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Build Reputation:</strong> Gain a verified status on the platform.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[#064e3b]/80\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#059669] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Drive Quality:</strong> Ensure the ecosystem remains trustworthy.</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-[#064e3b] p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg shadow-[#064e3b]/20 border border-[#064e3b] relative overflow-hidden group\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#059669] rounded-bl-full -mr-8 -mt-8 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110 opacity-50\"></div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-6 relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white text-[#064e3b] flex items-center justify-center text-xl\">🤝</span>For Partners</h3><ul class=\"space-y-4 relative z-10\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Scale Impact:</strong> Co-fund massive initiatives with syndicates.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Exclusive Access:</strong> Get early looks at vetted, high-tier projects.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-white/90\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-[#34d399] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\"></path></svg><span><strong>Custom Deals:</strong> Negotiate equity or revenue sharing structures.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-white relative\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-4\">How It Works</h2><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#059669] mx-auto rounded-full mt-6\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:top-1/2 before:-translate-y-1/2 before:h-0.5 before:bg-[#ecfdf5] before:hidden lg:before:block\"><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-white border border-[#f2eadb] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#059669] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/20 border-4 border-white\">01</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-3\">Discover</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70\">Browse through our curated list of audited, high-potential projects.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-white border border-[#f2eadb] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#059669] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/20 border-4 border-white\">02</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-3\">Fund</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70\">Rigorous vetting ensures only viable projects make it to the platform.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-white border border-[#f2eadb] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#059669] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/20 border-4 border-white\">03</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-3\">Secure Funding</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70\">Backers commit funds securely via escrow smart contracts.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 bg-white border border-[#f2eadb] p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm text-center\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-[#059669] text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold mx-auto mb-6 shadow-lg shadow-[#059669]/20 border-4 border-white\">04</div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-3\">Execute &amp; Return</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70\">Funds are released on milestones. Returns flow directly to backers.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-[#059669] hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors group\" href=\"/how-it-works\">See the full process<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-[#fdfbf7] relative border-y border-[#059669]/5\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-end mb-12\"><div><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-4\">Featured Projects</h2><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#059669] rounded-full mt-2\"></div></div><a class=\"hidden lg:inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-[#059669] hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors group\" href=\"/projects\">View all projects<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-md shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] group hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#059669]/10 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-200 overflow-hidden relative\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-[#059669] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full z-10\">Tech</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Tech Project\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"/></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2 line-clamp-1\">NextGen Solar Processor</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 text-sm mb-6 line-clamp-2\">Revolutionary chip design that runs entirely on ambient light, reducing carbon footprint for IoT devices.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-[#059669]\">$125,000</span><span class=\"text-[#064e3b]/50\">of $100k goal</span></div><div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[#059669] w-[125%] rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4\"><span class=\"font-medium text-[#064e3b]\">1,042 Backers</span><span class=\"font-medium text-[#059669]\">4 Days Left</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-md shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] group hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#059669]/10 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-200 overflow-hidden relative\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-[#059669] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full z-10\">Design</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586023492125-27b2c045efd7?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Design Project\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"/></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2 line-clamp-1\">The Modular Desk Ecosystem</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 text-sm mb-6 line-clamp-2\">A completely customizable workspace solution that adapts to your posture and workflow dynamically.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-[#059669]\">$45,000</span><span class=\"text-[#064e3b]/50\">of $50k goal</span></div><div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[#059669] w-[90%] rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4\"><span class=\"font-medium text-[#064e3b]\">312 Backers</span><span class=\"font-medium text-orange-500\">12 Days Left</span></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-md shadow-[#059669]/5 border border-[#f2eadb] group hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-[#059669]/10 transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"h-48 bg-gray-200 overflow-hidden relative\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur text-[#059669] text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full z-10\">Film</div><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1485846234645-a62644f84728?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Film Project\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"/></div><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-2 line-clamp-1\">Echoes of Tomorrow</h3><p class=\"text-[#064e3b]/70 text-sm mb-6 line-clamp-2\">An independent sci-fi feature film exploring the ethical implications of memory modification technology.</p><div class=\"mb-4\"><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm mb-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-[#059669]\">$210,000</span><span class=\"text-[#064e3b]/50\">of $150k goal</span></div><div class=\"w-full h-2 bg-[#ecfdf5] rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[#059669] w-full rounded-full\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-sm text-[#064e3b]/70 border-t border-gray-100 pt-4\"><span class=\"font-medium text-[#064e3b]\">2,150 Backers</span><span class=\"font-medium text-blue-500\">Funded</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 text-center lg:hidden\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-bold text-[#059669] hover:text-[#064e3b] transition-colors group\" href=\"/projects\">View all projects<svg class=\"w-5 h-5 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\"></path></svg></a></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-[#064e3b] mb-4\">Success Stories</h2><div class=\"w-24 h-1 bg-[#059669] mx-auto rounded-full mt-6\"></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"bg-[#fdfbf7] p-8 lg:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#f2eadb] relative\"><svg class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-12 h-12 text-[#059669]/10\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path d=\"M9.352 4C4.456 7.456 1 13.12 1 19.36c0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.36 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.208-5.472-5.088-5.472-.576 0-1.344.096-1.536.192.48-3.264 3.552-7.104 6.624-9.024L9.352 4zm16.512 0c-4.8 3.456-8.256 9.12-8.256 15.36 0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.264 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.304-5.472-5.184-5.472-.576 0-1.248.096-1.44.192.48-3.264 3.456-7.104 6.528-9.024L25.864 4z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-lg text-[#064e3b]/80 italic mb-8 relative z-10\">&quot;Jade Fortune made the entire funding process seamless. Not only did we hit our goal in record time, but the auditing process gave our backers the confidence they needed.&quot;</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-gray-300 rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=150&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Sarah J.\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/></div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b]\">Sarah Jenkins</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-[#059669]\">Creator, Modular Desk</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-[#fdfbf7] p-8 lg:p-10 rounded-3xl border border-[#f2eadb] relative\"><svg class=\"absolute top-6 right-6 w-12 h-12 text-[#059669]/10\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\"><path d=\"M9.352 4C4.456 7.456 1 13.12 1 19.36c0 5.088 3.072 8.064 6.624 8.064 3.36 0 5.856-2.688 5.856-5.856 0-3.168-2.304-5.472-5.184-5.472-.576 0-1.248.096-1.44.192.48-3.264 3.456-7.104 6.528-9.024L25.864 4z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-lg text-[#064e3b]/80 italic mb-8 relative z-10\">&quot;As an investor, security is my top priority. The transparent auditing and regular updates provided by this platform are unparalleled in the crowdfunding space.&quot;</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-gray-300 rounded-full overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=150&amp;q=80\" alt=\"Michael T.\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\"/></div><div><h4 class=\"font-bold text-[#064e3b]\">Michael Torres</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-[#059669]\">Super Backer</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#064e3b]\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#059669] rounded-full filter blur-3xl opacity-50 transform translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#059669] rounded-full filter blur-3xl opacity-50 transform -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6\">Ready to Shape the Future?</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-white/80 mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Join thousands of innovators and backers building the next generation of groundbreaking products.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 mb-16\"><a class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-white text-[#064e3b] rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-50 active:scale-95 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-black/10\" href=\"/register\">Get Started Now</a></div><div class=\"bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-8 rounded-3xl max-w-xl mx-auto\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4\">Stay in the loop</h3><p class=\"text-white/70 mb-6 text-sm\">Subscribe to our newsletter for the latest projects and platform updates.</p><form class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email address\" class=\"flex-grow px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/20 text-white placeholder-white/50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#34d399] transition-all\" required=\"\"/><button type=\"submit\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#059669] text-white font-bold rounded-xl hover:bg-[#047857] transition-colors whitespace-nowrap\">Subscribe</button></form></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-diamond-grid-green text-[#fdfbf7]/80 py-12 mt-auto border-t border-[#10b981]/20 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#10b981] to-[#064e3b]\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));gap:3rem\"><div style=\"grid-column:1 / -1;max-width:400px\" class=\"mb-4\"><a class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[#fdfbf7] flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\" href=\"/\"><svg class=\"w-8 h-8 filter drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.45)] hover:rotate-12 transition-transform duration-300\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9 9H15L17 2H7L9 9Z\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\"></path><path d=\"M7 2L9 9H2L7 2Z\" fill=\"#34d399\"></path><path d=\"M17 2L15 9H22L17 2Z\" fill=\"#059669\"></path><path d=\"M9 9H15L12 22L9 9Z\" fill=\"#10b981\"></path><path d=\"M2 9H9L12 22L2 9Z\" fill=\"#065f46\"></path><path d=\"M15 9H22L12 22L15 9Z\" fill=\"#047857\"></path></svg>Jade Fortune</a><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">Pioneering the future of crowdfunding. We connect visionary projects with issuers and investors globally, ensuring transparency and success.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-[#fdfbf7] font-semibold mb-4 tracking-wide uppercase text-sm\">Platform</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-[#10b981] tran